<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#F7F9FC', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 12, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 80px', gap: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 200, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', opacity: 0.9, width: 320 }}>02</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 22, flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>数据治理与数仓建模</Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 2, width: 120, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                清洗不是"跑通就行"：三站分层管道让每一步可回溯，<br />
                五类脏数据全部 100% 修复或隔离留痕，行数逐环节闭环对账。<br />
                星型模型 + 动态分区 + 命名规范，构成分析层的可信底座。
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
                {['五维质检', '三站管道', '星型模型', '分区裁剪'].map(t => (
                    <Box key={t} style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 20, padding: '8px 22px' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{t}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'flex-end', padding: '0 60px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>云购生活数据仓库 · 200A</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
